{"a":[162,162],"h":"<p>Bu dini kayyimin hasleti ameliyyesini hulâsaten beyan için 162.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 50.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 27.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şöyle de:<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"103\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 102.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.8 27.8 34.6 46.6 69.0 69.0 79.6 79.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.8 46.6 69.0 86.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> her halde benim namazım<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"83\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 83.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.7 27.7 39.7 51.7 51.7 58.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 58.6 66.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve ıbadetlerim -yâhud kurbanlarım<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"145\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 145.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.8 27.8 34.6 41.3 50.3 57.0 74.3 87.8 94.6 101.3 101.3 114.0 120.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"41.3 50.3 57.0 74.3 94.6 114.0 120.8 129.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve hayatım ve mematım<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"158\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 158.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 33.7 33.7 42.7 50.2 57.0 63.7 63.7 71.2 87.0 87.0 87.0 103.4 120.7 120.7 127.4 127.4 127.4 134.2 134.2\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 42.7 57.0 103.4 141.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> rabbül'âlemîn olan Allahındı